  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile settings with scvi_n200 (config_006) achieve higher accuracy than singleprofile (config_004) or pca_n2000 (config_002). Testing pca_n2000 with transformer aggregation (config_003) isolates the impact of aggregation methods on a lower-performing encoder, clarifying whether transformer aggregation provides consistent gains across different RNA encoders. This addresses uncertainty about aggregation strategy's role and supports comparison with scvi_n200's transformer setup (config_006)."
